    "Contrast geocentric vs heliocentric explanations in terms of explanatory parsimony and observational fit.",
    "Predict when retrograde motion occurs for an outer planet based on relative orbital motion and configuration.",
    "Compare retrograde loop sizes for Mars, Jupiter, and Saturn and relate differences to orbital radii and relative speeds."
